You can use a crystal ball to detect traps by searching for ^, and I
used the PYEC to keep it charged.

Pets won't attack a monster two levels higher than them, so the
strategy for dealing with Rodney was to use the Staff of Aesculapius to
drain enough levels off of him where the Archon would finish him off. A
better solution would have been to boost his level with potions, but I
didn't come across enough of them, and it was hard enough to get my
level high enough to do the quest. This is covered in the pacifist faq,
if you want more details.

This strategy doesn't work for Orcus, since demons are level drain
resistant. I just bought off the other two demon lords, and my plan was
to avoid Orcus, so I just teleported him out of the way on the trip
down. The trip back up wasn't so easy. I hope I answered all your
questions.


